====
SYS.SQLSEC
====
^MAC^Save for Source Control^^~Format=IRIS.S~^UTF8
%RO
%SYS.SQLSEC^MAC^^^0
%SYSSQLSEC ;(SQL Security Routines)
	;; COMPONENTS :: SQL/Security
	#;
#include %sySystem
#include %msql
#include %sySecurity
#include %SYS.DBSRV
#INCLUDE %syAudit
#IF 0   ;
	;---------------------------------------------------------------------
	; Description:   Security Routine
	; Author:        David Van De Griek
	; Date:          October 8, 1998
	; Maintenance History: [ XXXnnn (MM/DD/YY) - Description ]
	;
	;  JO3030  (12/29/2017) - Jeffrey Orlin, Cache->IRIS Updates
